Description: Download YouTube videos, files, and torrents
 Yoink is a cross-platform desktop app for downloading YouTube videos, direct
 file links, and torrents, with a queue, scheduling, concurrency limits, and
 speed limits.
 .
 Ships self-contained (bundles its own .NET runtime) — no separate runtime
 dependency. yt-dlp and ffmpeg are downloaded and managed by the app itself
 the first time they're needed if not already on PATH.
